  "conclusion": {
    "zh": "646车系、1,510条完整车系×年记录的分组交叉验证中，加入配置后R²由0.070提升至0.239（+0.169）；该结果量化产品属性对年度跨车系差异的样本外解释力，不进行因果识别。完整模型年度截面WMAPE为73.85%，作为模块内辅助误差指标，与月度预测指标分别报告。",
    "en": "Across 646 series and 1,510 complete series-year rows, grouped CV R² rises from 0.070 to 0.239 (+0.169) after adding configuration. The result quantifies out-of-sample explanatory power for annual between-series variation without causal identification. The full model's annual cross-sectional WMAPE is 73.85%, reported as a module-specific supporting metric separately from monthly forecasting."
